ts":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>When the arboreal husk hits a creature with its blighted branch or blighted root, the creature must make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:25|name:Draining Impact|traits:primal|showDC:gm]{Fortitude} save. Whatever the result, the creature is immune to the same arboreal husk's draining impact for 24 hours.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2}.</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"NMljvKTtKDmOHPST","name":"Raise Tree","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The arboreal husk causes a dead tree within 180 feet to uproot itself and fight as a minion using the statistics for an @Compendium[pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary.oBMIc2S8ekmDgPpi]{Awakened Tree} with the husk trait. The arboreal husk can control up to two awakened trees at a time, and it can issue commands to both trees as a single action, which has the concentrate and auditory traits.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ytKawNGSES7gYFoQ","name":"Sow Despair","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Few can shake the sorrow caused by the sight of a forest guardian so corrupted. The arboreal husk makes a single Intimidation check to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} all creatures within 30 feet. In addition to the usual effects of Demoralize, on a critical success, the husk counteracts any beneficial emotion effects affecting the target.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","emotion","fear","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"RBkGk884CJs93QEi","name":"Innate Primal Spells","type":"